{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52999","headline":"七言谒倍城县南香积寺老师一首 · 李嘉佑","name":"七言谒倍城县南香积寺老师一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹林青青山寺幽，老僧禅坐对江流。\n长眉（尘）亷襜寂不语，能令过客小低头。\n黄昏钟竟香烟起，行舟去去心何已。\n回看石壁莲花宫，纱灯一点蒙笼里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}